senses.gloss:
(I)--a son of Ugrasena;
1: भा. IX. २४. २४; Br. III. ७१. १३३; M. ४४. ७४; वा. ९६. १३२; Vi. IV. १४. २०.
a brother of Kamsa; on the latter's death came to encounter कृष्ण and was killed. ^2 Vi. V. २०. ९०.

(I)--a queen of उत्तानपाद and mother of Dhruva. Not loved by her husband she was banished; wel- comed Dhruva returning after tapas, and embraced him with affection; went to heaven in front of Dhruva;
1: भा. IV. 8. 8 & ६५; 9. ४१, ४९-50; १२. ३२-33; Vi. I. ११. 3.
lament of, at her child's severe penance;
2: Ib. I. १२. १४-21.
attained the status of तारक.
3: Ib. I. १२. ९४.
